# Corpora are fetched, never committed - see scripts/fetch_corpus.py.
# Two reasons, not just size (enwik8 alone is 100 MB):
#   - these are other people's texts under their own licences, and this repo is
#     MIT. Redistributing them here would be relicensing what is not ours.
#   - the 2026 arXiv control text carries its author's contact details, which
#     should not be republished into a public repo for scrapers to harvest.
# The fetch script reproduces every file and verifies it, which is all
# reproducibility actually requires.
corpus/*

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store

# No blanket *.md here, and that is deliberate. A whitelist ignored three real
# benchmark reports for a week: RANK_1/2/3_REPORT.md held the only copy of the
# SmolLM2-360M, book1 and enwik8_1m numbers, and none of them reached
# results/results.json. Measurements belong in the JSON; if a report is scratch,
# name it scratch_*.md and it will be ignored below.
scratch_*.md
